Package: dflimit
Type: Package
Title: Exact Limiting Distribution of the Dickey-Fuller t-Ratio
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Yong", "Bao", role = c("aut", "cph")),
    person("Simon A.", "Broda", email = "s.a.broda@uva.nl", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("Raymond", "Kan", role = c("aut", "cph")),
    person("Steven G.", "Johnson", role = "ctb",
           comment = "author of the Faddeeva package in src/Faddeeva.cc and src/Faddeeva.hh"),
    person("Massachusetts Institute of Technology", role = "cph",
           comment = "copyright holder of the Faddeeva package"))
Description: The distribution function, density, quantiles and moments of the
    limits of the Dickey-Fuller t-ratios under local alternatives, for the
    regression without deterministic terms, with an intercept, and with an
    intercept and a trend, with a zero, a fixed or a stationary initial
    observation, and for the t-ratio centred at a local null value; also the
    GLS-detrended trend case of Elliott, Rothenberg and Stock (1996)
    <doi:10.2307/2171846>, the ADFmax statistic of Leybourne (1995)
    <doi:10.1111/j.1468-0084.1995.mp57004008.x> and the probabilities of regions
    of the limit experiment.  The values are computed by the exact
    representations of Bao, Broda and Kan, "The Exact Limiting Distribution of
    the Dickey-Fuller t-Ratio and Some Related Statistics" (working paper), in
    a multithreaded C engine.
